{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Irezumi Defenders</strong></u> is a tower defense game where you craft your units in a world inspired by Japanese mythology. Stack cards to craft buildings, gather resources, and build up your defenses to protect your kingdom from Yokai! \ud83d\udc7a</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053750/extras/3eb7b28e366362c0ba723023062545f6.avif?t=1767622699\" width=1560 height=267 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >80+ cards to unlock \ud83c\udfb4</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4-5 hours of gameplay \u23f2\ufe0f</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9+ different enemies \ud83d\udc79</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30+ quests to complete \ud83d\udcdc</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30+ achievements to unlock \ud83c\udf1f</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your difficulty \ud83e\udd9d\u200b</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No-pause mode for more challenges \u23ef\ufe0f</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053750/extras/410417af1d88d112a2003d9d6ac3c977.avif?t=1767622699\" width=1560 height=267 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stack your cards to produce new resources, maximize your production, and craft your Japanese mythology-inspired defense units before the wave of Yokai arrives!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053750/extras/996c4499e716714bd6ffbfa8ed4fb4a2.poster.avif?t=1767622699\" width=600 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053750/extras/996c4499e716714bd6ffbfa8ed4fb4a2.webm?t=1767622699\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053750/extras/996c4499e716714bd6ffbfa8ed4fb4a2.mp4?t=1767622699\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053750/extras/d89d86d78769ceb9a7c590c495e93014.avif?t=1767622699\" width=1560 height=267 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive waves of increasingly powerful Yokai, face elites with unique skills, and defeat the ultimate opponent of the Kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053750/extras/14832308897e090c84ed4229110b2809.poster.avif?t=1767622699\" width=600 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053750/extras/14832308897e090c84ed4229110b2809.webm?t=1767622699\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053750/extras/14832308897e090c84ed4229110b2809.mp4?t=1767622699\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053750/extras/17874129b5ef3484d3e920c7ab3f2d42.avif?t=1767622699\" width=1560 height=267 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell cards to collect ink needed to purchase new boosters! These may contain ideas for crafting new cards that you can keep between games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_i